id: pm-bfa1ob
title: Commander usage refusals omit token_accounting even when --token-accounting is parsed
description: "The CLI attaches token_accounting to successful commands and runtime PmCliError failures, but Commander usage failures such as an unknown option render before the accounting attachment path. A caller explicitly requesting --json --token-accounting therefore receives no receipt. The agent-task transcript gate currently measures these refusals independently and labels that boundary; the CLI should eventually make the self-reported contract uniform without changing exit semantics."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[5]: agent-ux,"area:cli",contracts,error-contract,token-accounting
created_at: "2026-08-27T16:44:18.236Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-05T04:18:39.659Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-05T04:18:39.090Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-05T04:18:39.090Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Commander JSON usage errors attach the same bounded token_accounting receipt when requested; accounting-off bytes remain unchanged; CLI order and alias forms behave identically; focused process tests and the golden transcript switch from independent_transport to self_reported.
parent: pm-srns
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: medium
environment: CLI Commander parse-time usage failures across JSON and TOON transports
repro_steps: Run pm --json --token-accounting search query --include-body and observe an unknown-option refusal without token_accounting.
resolution: Attached exact serialized token accounting to Commander and bootstrap JSON refusals after projection and extension enrichment; strengthened independent transcript provenance verification.
expected_result: Requested accounting matches emitted refusal bytes while accounting-off payloads remain unchanged.
actual_result: "Final local delivery evidence: pnpm quality:static passed; 8420 tests in 608 files passed with exact coverage statements 62214/62214, branches 47182/47182, functions 12920/12920, lines 59840/59840. Full typecheck, all six linked PM test runs, package-first dogfood (88 commands), temporary Node and Bun manual workflows, packed npm/npx/bunx consumers, compatibility migration, package artifact, docs/skills, SDK surface and contract checks passed. Refusal corpus closes 117/117 probes with negative controls; task-token corpus completes 8/8 tasks at 12667 estimated tokens. Tracker-context 41 assertions, graph-composition 10 assertions, and record-integrity pass. GitHub security inventories and pnpm audit are zero; fresh required Sentry/telemetry gate passes. PR review, merge, and publication remain separate subsequent claims."
